{"id":"5c1f6f430663d687","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-gaps.md","title":"Hausdorff Gaps","display":"df-gaps — Hausdorff Gaps","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-gaps","aliases":["58-df-gaps"],"display":"df-gaps — Hausdorff Gaps","depends_on":["[[58-df-regular]]","[[58-df-finite]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-gaps"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-gaps</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gaps — Hausdorff Gaps"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d83de8696e4dad26\" href=\"?note=d83de8696e4dad26\" title=\"58-df-regular\">58-df-regular</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite\">58-df-finite</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Reg}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Reg}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d83de8696e4dad26\" href=\"?note=d83de8696e4dad26\" title=\"58-df-regular\">58-df-regular</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^\\kappa\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^\\kappa\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (finite-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite\">58-df-finite</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\subseteq^*\\;\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)^2\">\\(\\subseteq^*\\;\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)^2\\)</span> (mod-finite inclusion defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PreGap}_S,\\mathrm{Gap}_S,\\mathrm{HausdorffGap}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PreGap}_S,\\mathrm{Gap}_S,\\mathrm{HausdorffGap}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gaps\\text{-}almost\\text{-}inclusion} \\vdash X\\subseteq^*Y\\leftrightarrow X,Y\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(X\\setminus Y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gaps\\text{-}almost\\text{-}inclusion} \\vdash X\\subseteq^*Y\\leftrightarrow X,Y\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(X\\setminus Y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gaps\\text{-}pregap} \\vdash \\mathrm{PreGap}_S(\\kappa,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land A,B\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^\\kappa\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\beta&lt;\\kappa\\;(A_\\alpha\\subseteq^*A_\\beta\\land B_\\alpha\\subseteq^*B_\\beta)\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta&lt;\\kappa\\;\\mathrm{Finite}(A_\\alpha\\cap B_\\beta)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gaps\\text{-}pregap} \\vdash \\mathrm{PreGap}_S(\\kappa,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land A,B\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^\\kappa\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\beta&lt;\\kappa\\;(A_\\alpha\\subseteq^*A_\\beta\\land B_\\alpha\\subseteq^*B_\\beta)\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta&lt;\\kappa\\;\\mathrm{Finite}(A_\\alpha\\cap B_\\beta)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gaps\\text{-}gap} \\vdash \\mathrm{Gap}_S(\\kappa,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PreGap}_S(\\kappa,A,B)\\land\\neg\\exists C\\subseteq\\omega\\;\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;(A_\\alpha\\subseteq^*C\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(C\\cap B_\\alpha))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gaps\\text{-}gap} \\vdash \\mathrm{Gap}_S(\\kappa,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PreGap}_S(\\kappa,A,B)\\land\\neg\\exists C\\subseteq\\omega\\;\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;(A_\\alpha\\subseteq^*C\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(C\\cap B_\\alpha))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gaps\\text{-}hausdorff} \\vdash \\mathrm{HausdorffGap}_S(\\kappa,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Gap}_S(\\kappa,A,B)\\land\\forall\\beta&lt;\\kappa\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Finite}(\\{\\alpha\\in\\beta:A_\\alpha\\setminus A_\\beta\\subseteq n\\})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gaps\\text{-}hausdorff} \\vdash \\mathrm{HausdorffGap}_S(\\kappa,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Gap}_S(\\kappa,A,B)\\land\\forall\\beta&lt;\\kappa\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Finite}(\\{\\alpha\\in\\beta:A_\\alpha\\setminus A_\\beta\\subseteq n\\})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Here the two indexed families consist of subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> indexes the families.</li>\n<li>The final conjunct is the Hausdorff condition. A gap need not satisfy it.</li>\n<li>The regular-cardinal and finiteness predicates now carry the unary signatures used by their source atoms; both indexed objects are explicitly functions in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\omega)^\\kappa\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\omega)^\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-regular","status":"resolved","id":"d83de8696e4dad26","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-regular]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular","status":"resolved","id":"d83de8696e4dad26","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\kappa\\in V$, with $\\mathrm{Reg}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ and $\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)$ (see [[58-df-regular]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (finite-set predicate, see [[58-df-finite]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Reg}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\subseteq^*\\;\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PreGap}_S,\\mathrm{Gap}_S,\\mathrm{HausdorffGap}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gaps\\text{-}almost\\text{-}inclusion} \\vdash X\\subseteq^*Y\\leftrightarrow X,Y\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(X\\setminus Y)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gaps\\text{-}pregap} \\vdash \\mathrm{PreGap}_S(\\kappa,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land A,B\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^\\kappa\\land\\forall\\alpha<\\beta<\\kappa\\;(A_\\alpha\\subseteq^*A_\\beta\\land B_\\alpha\\subseteq^*B_\\beta)\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta<\\kappa\\;\\mathrm{Finite}(A_\\alpha\\cap B_\\beta)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gaps\\text{-}gap} \\vdash \\mathrm{Gap}_S(\\kappa,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PreGap}_S(\\kappa,A,B)\\land\\neg\\exists C\\subseteq\\omega\\;\\forall\\alpha<\\kappa\\;(A_\\alpha\\subseteq^*C\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(C\\cap B_\\alpha))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gaps\\text{-}hausdorff} \\vdash \\mathrm{HausdorffGap}_S(\\kappa,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Gap}_S(\\kappa,A,B)\\land\\forall\\beta<\\kappa\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Finite}(\\{\\alpha\\in\\beta:A_\\alpha\\setminus A_\\beta\\subseteq n\\})","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\omega)^\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":2009,"backlinks":[{"id":"ab9eeb02fa679c0c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"39106533930cb3c4","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"Mod-finite inclusion comes from [[58-df-gaps]]; the former stationary-set splitting dependency did not define this symbol. Every assertion now has a unique label."},{"id":"6c0f253ee0c7cafe","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"The mod-finite inclusion relation is supplied directly by [[58-df-gaps]]."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-572","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-gaps.md|58-df-gaps]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["d83de8696e4dad26","d9a25b0ac94a3598"]}